Labor Warranty</h2>\n\n</div>\n    </div>\n\n<div  class=\"card collapse-on-mobile p-4 has-white-background-color\" style=\"\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n    <div class=\"iconblock mb-3 wp-elements-12 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">10-Years Annual System Cleanings</h2>\n\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center mb-2 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Plus:</strong></p>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Remote monitoring capabilities — Transfer to new owners — Surge protection device⁺⁺⁺</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"compare\" class=\"wp-block-group container py-5\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading h-decorator h-decorator--primary has-secondary-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-13\">No surprises. No uncertainty. It’s all fixed.</h2>\n\n<p class=\"my-3 wp-block-paragraph\">You get your new HVAC unit, yearly regular HVAC maintenance and cleaning, plus parts and labor coverage⁺ for the next ten years all bundled together into one complete package. No separate purchases. With the Worry-Free Program, it&#8217;s one and done. Feel comfortable — know you&#8217;re covered.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<table role=\"table\"  class=\"comparetable mt-4\" style=\"--comparetable-accent: var(--wp--preset--color--secondary); --comparetable-inverse: var(--wp--preset