n class=\"comparetable-cell-value\">None⁺</span>\n            </td>\n            <td role=\"cell\" class=\"comparetable-cell comparetable-cell--standard\">\n                <span class=\"comparetable-cell-columnheader-label\">Industry Standard HVAC Package</span>\n                <span class=\"comparetable-cell-value\">$100–$150 per visit</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n                <tr role=\"row\" class=\"comparetable-row\">\n            <th scope=\"row\" role=\"rowheader\" class=\"comparetable-header\">Payment</th>\n            <td role=\"cell\" class=\"comparetable-cell comparetable-cell--highlight\">\n                <span class=\"comparetable-cell-columnheader-label\">Worry-Free Program</span>\n                <span class=\"comparetable-cell-value\">A Fixed Cost⁺</span>\n            </td>\n            <td role=\"cell\" class=\"comparetable-cell comparetable-cell--standard\">\n                <span class=\"comparetable-cell-columnheader-label\">Industry Standard HVAC Package</span>\n                <span class=\"comparetable-cell-value\">Unexpected and varying amounts</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n            </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"our-experience\" class=\"container splitter\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--stretch\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full w100\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-retreiving-an-item-from-a-service-truck.jpg\" alt=\"A 2nd Wind Heating and Air Conditioning technician retreiving an item from a service truck\" class=\"wp-image-5698\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-retreiving-an-item-from-a-service-truck.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-retreiving-an-item-from-a-service-truck-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-retreiving-an-item-from-a-service-truck-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-retreiving-an-item-from-a-service-truck-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-retreiving-an-item-from-a-service-truck-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow mt-3 is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Leveraging our experience to transform yours</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We saw a gap and filled it with a program that takes all the guesswork out of HVAC and goes beyond traditional HVAC maintenance or warranty programs — because you get both in one. </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It’s a level of coverage so extraordinary only an established industry leader like us can offer it for your air conditioning units and HVAC systems. So you know that whatever breaks, our commitment won’t.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--stretch\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover h100 p-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-40 has-background-dim\"></span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2284\" height=\"1280\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-5034\" alt=\"An exterior of a building with multiple AC units and flowers\" src=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-building-with-multiple-AC-units-and-flowers.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/An-exterior-of-a-bu