google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text\">\n                Reviews <span class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text__stars\">★★★★★</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating\"><div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars\">\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__score\">\n                5/5\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__number-of-reviews\">\n                <span>18 Reviews</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n        <!-- reviews body -->\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__body\">\n                                                <!-- review carousel -->\n                <div class=\"nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height\">                    <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Romesha Ellick\" aria-label=\"Romesha Ellick\">Romesha Ellick</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>2nd Wind was able to come out the same day and look at my HVAC. The tech was nice, professional and direct. He told me exactly what to expect and provided me a good quote. He made the experience very easy.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Matt Marks\" aria-label=\"Matt Marks\">Matt Marks</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Incredibly fast response time. I called on Thursday afternoon and they were installing my unit on Friday morning. The installation itself was also fast. The follow up service was incredibly helpful and reliable.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"George Park\" aria-label=\"George Park\">George Park</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Have used 2nd Wind for the 18 years I have been in my house. They have always been professional and responsive. Today I had them perform a real estate pre-inspection as I prepare to sell my house. Everything checked out perfectly, as I expected, knowing the service they have provided.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"carousel-dots\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"1\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot selected\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"2\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-inde